      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<figure><img alt=\"Trail Running in Wine Country Brought the Joy Back to My Routine\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wine-country-running_golden-hour.jpg?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>A trip to California wine country cured my marathon training burnout and reminded me why I love the sport.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/adventure-travel/destinations/north-america/trail-running-vacation-sonoma/\">Trail Running in Wine Country Brought the Joy Back to My Routine</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
